{"unit_id": "tag:0072:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个范畴（category），它有积（products）。考虑预层（presheaf）<MATH_0003>，它取值于<MATH_0004>，定义在<MATH_0005>上。称它为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>层（sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对于每个开覆盖（covering），图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0006>\n都是等化子（equalizer）图表（diagram）（在范畴（category）<MATH_0007>中）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "定义所用的底空间。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "具有积的取值范畴。"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "取值范畴须具有的积。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "接受层条件检验的对象。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "本定义所界定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "层条件涉及的任意开覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "开覆盖所对应的待检验图表。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "层条件指定的范畴构造。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "在层条件中被要求为等化子图表。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "考察等化子图表的范畴。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0071:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个范畴（category），且<MATH_0002>是一个忠实（faithful）函子（functor）。一个值得记住的例子是，<MATH_0003>取为范畴（category）“阿贝尔群（abelian groups）”，<MATH_0004>取为遗忘函子（functor）。考察预层（presheaf）<MATH_0005>，它取值于<MATH_0006>，定义在<MATH_0007>上。我们希望用其底层预层（presheaf）（取值于集合（sets））来重新表述上述条件（定义<REF_0001>）。注意，底层预层（presheaf）（取值于集合（sets））是层（sheaf）（取值于集合（sets）），当且仅当所有图表（diagrams）\n<MATH_0008>\n（由集合（sets）组成，是应用遗忘函子（functor）<MATH_0009>后所得的）都是等化子（equalizer）图表（diagrams）！因此，我们希望<MATH_0010>有积（products）和等化子（equalizers），并希望<MATH_0011>与它们交换（commute）。这等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0012>有极限（limits）且<MATH_0013>与它们交换（commutes），见《范畴（Categories）》中的引理<REF_0002>。但这还不够（见例<REF_0003>），还要求<MATH_0014><TEXTITOPEN_0001>反映同构（isomorphisms）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。这一性质是指，给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>（在<MATH_0016>中），则<MATH_0017>是同构（isomorphism），当（且仅当）<MATH_0018>是双射（bijection）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "equalizers", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "段首所设的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实", "context": "所设函子的性质。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "具有忠实性的函子。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "作为例子所取的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "所举范畴的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "例子中的遗忘函子。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "考察层条件的原对象。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用来重新表述条件的底层对象。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "重新表述中底层预层的取值。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "等价陈述中待检验的底层对象。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "等价陈述中底层预层的取值。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "等价陈述中的层条件。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "等价陈述中层的取值。"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表", "context": "等价条件所量化的所有图表。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "遗忘后图表中的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "此处应用的遗忘函子。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "图表满足的普遍性质。"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表", "context": "此处与等化子合称。"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "希望取值范畴具有的构造之一。"}, {"source_term": "equalizers", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "希望取值范畴具有的另一构造。"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换", "context": "表示函子与积及等化子交换。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "表示前后两组条件的逻辑关系。"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限", "context": "等价条件所要求的范畴构造。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "表示函子与极限交换。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引引理所在的章节标题。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "须由函子反映的态射类型。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "说明反映性质时所给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "由双射条件判定的性质。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "函子给出的集合映射所满足的条件。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0073:statement", "translation": "设范畴（category）<MATH_0001>与函子（functor）<MATH_0002>具有以下性质。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>是忠实（faithful）的，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004>有极限（limits），且<MATH_0005>与它们交换（commutes），并且\n<STRUCT_0004> 函子（functor）<MATH_0006>反映同构（isomorphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n设<MATH_0007>是拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0008>是一个预层（presheaf），取值于<MATH_0009>。则<MATH_0010>是层（sheaf），当且仅当其底层预层（presheaf）（取值于集合（sets））是层（sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "引理假设所涉及的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "引理假设所涉及的函子。"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实", "context": "第一项假设。"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限", "context": "第二项假设中要求存在的构造。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "第二项假设中函子与极限的关系。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "第三项假设的主语。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第三项假设中函子反映的态射类型。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "引理所设的底空间。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "由引理判定是否为层的对象。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "等价陈述中原对象的性质。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "等价陈述中的底层对象。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "底层预层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "等价陈述中底层对象的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0073:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>是层（sheaf）。那么<MATH_0002>是等化子（equalizer），这里取上面的图表（diagram）。由假设可知，<MATH_0003>是等化子（equalizer），这里取相应的图表（diagram）（由集合（sets）组成）。因此<MATH_0004>是层（sheaf）（取值于集合（sets））。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设<MATH_0005>是层（sheaf）。令<MATH_0006>为等化子（equalizer），所等化的是定义<REF_0001>中的两个平行箭头。我们得到典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0007>，只须用到<MATH_0008>是预层（presheaf）这一点。根据假设，诱导映射（induced map）<MATH_0009>是同构（isomorphism），因为<MATH_0010>是等化子（equalizer），这里取相应的图表（diagram）（由集合（sets）组成）。因此，根据引理的条件（3），<MATH_0011>是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "正向证明的假设。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "正向证明中由层条件得到的构造。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "正向证明中所引用的上文图表。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "应用假设后所得的构造。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "正向证明中的对应图表。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "正向证明中对应图表的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "正向证明得到的性质。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "正向证明所得层的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "反向证明的假设。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "由定义中的平行箭头所取的构造。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "由预层性质得到的态射。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "保证得到典范态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射", "context": "反向证明中由典范态射诱导的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "诱导映射具有的性质。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "判定诱导映射为同构所用的构造。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "反向证明中的对应图表。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "反向证明中对应图表的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "利用引理第三个条件得到的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0071:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n该引理尤其适用于<TEXTITOPEN_0001>下列层（sheaves），它们分别取值于群（groups）、环（rings）、代数（algebras）（在一个固定的环（ring）上）、模（modules）（在一个固定的环（ring）上）、向量空间（vector spaces）（在一个固定的域（field）上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>等。换言之，这些是预层（presheaves），它们分别取值于群（groups）、环（rings）、模（modules）（在一个固定的环（ring）上）、向量空间（vector spaces）（在一个固定的域（field）上）等，且其底层预层（presheaf）（取值于集合（sets））是层（sheaf）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "引理适用的一系列层。"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群", "context": "第一列举中层的一类取值。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "第一列举中层的一类取值。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一列举中层在固定环上的取值类型之一。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "代数所依赖的固定基环。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一列举中层在固定环上的另一取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "第一列举中模所依赖的固定基环。"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "第一列举中层在固定域上的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第一列举中向量空间的固定标量域。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "改述中列举的预层。"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群", "context": "改述中预层的一类取值。"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "改述中预层的一类取值。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "改述中预层在固定环上的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "改述中模所依赖的固定基环。"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "改述中预层在固定域上的取值类型。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "改述中向量空间的固定标量域。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "末句所检验的底层对象。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "末句中底层预层的取值。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "末句要求底层预层满足的性质。"}], "notes": []}
